  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1103780291530719333/deuf-refabricated.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"201\" height=\"201\" /></p>\n<h5><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=88b930&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/elocindev\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=支持我們&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=88b930&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a></h5>\n<h5>&nbsp;&nbsp;</h5>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>DEUF Refabricated</strong> 是 <a href=\"https://github.com/CAS-ual-TY/DuplicateEntityUUIDFix\">CAS-ual-TY 的 DEUF（重複實體 UUID 修復器）</a>模組的 Fabric 移植版本。它修復了重複的 UUID，消除了日誌中的垃圾訊息，同時也解決了一些崩潰問題。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">此模組只需在伺服器端安裝即可生效。但建議將其包含在模組包中，以便在單人遊戲時也能修復這些問題。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">實體僅在生成時會被修復，這意味著如果你的世界中已經存在重複的實體，此模組無法修復它們，你必須手動移除。在安裝此模組後生成的未來實體將不會出現重複問題。</p>",
